# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"A real-time recreation of Eric Graham's 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\" demo: a GLSL\n"
"port of his recursive ray tracer. The robot, the balls, the checkerboard\n"
"floor and the mirror reflections are all generated and raytraced "
"procedurally.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Eric Grahami 1987. aasta Amiga \"Jongleri\" demo reaalajas taastamine: GLSL\n"
"oma rekursiivse kiirte jälgija port. Robot, pallid, malelaud\n"
"põrand ja peegli peegeldused genereeritakse ja jälgitakse "
"protseduuriliselt.\n"
"\n"
"Kirjutas Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "

