msgstr "Esper"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/esper.xml.h:10
msgid ""
"\n"
"\"Enhance 224 to 176. Pull out track right. Center in pull back.  Pull\n"
"back. Wait a minute. Go right. Stop. Enhance 57 19. Track 45 left.\n"
"Gimme a hardcopy right there.\"\n"
"\n"
"The Esper Machine was a voice-controlled forensic device used by LAPD\n"
"in 2019, as documented in the 1982 film, Blade Runner.  It was capable\n"
"of enhancing photographs to an extreme degree, including reconstructing\n"
"different viewpoints within the space from the reflections on various\n"
"objects in the photograph.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2017.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\"Täiustage 224 kuni 176. Tõmmake rööbastee paremale välja. Tõmmake keskele "
"tagasi. Tõmmake\n"
"tagasi. Oota natuke. Mine paremale. Peatus. Täiustage 57 19. Rada 45 "
"vasakule.\n"
"Andke paberkoopia sinna.\"\n"
"\n"
"Esper Machine oli häälega juhitav kohtuekspertiisi seade, mida LAPD kasutas\n"
"aastal 2019, nagu on dokumenteeritud 1982. aasta filmis Blade Runner.  See "
"oli võimeline\n"
"fotode äärmuslikul määral täiustamine, sealhulgas rekonstrueerimine\n"
"erinevad vaatenurgad ruumi sees alates peegeldustest erinevatele\n"
"objektid fotol.\n"
"\n"
"Kirjutas Jamie Zawinski; 2017. aasta.\n"
"  "

