# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/kaleidocycle.xml.h:22
msgid ""
"\n"
"Draw a ring composed of tetrahedra connected at the edges that twists\n"
"and rotates toroidally.\n"
"\n"
"When a series of tetrahedra are joined at the edges in a loop, it is\n"
"possible for them to rotate continously through the center without\n"
"deforming.  This only works with an even number of tetrahedra, and\n"
"there must be eight or more, or they don't fit.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2013.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Joonistage rõngas, mis koosneb servadest ühendatud tetraeedritest, mis "
"keerduvad\n"
"ja pöörleb toroidaalselt.\n"
"\n"
"Kui rida tetraeedreid on servadest silmuseks ühendatud, on see nii\n"
"võimalik, et nad pöörlevad pidevalt läbi keskpunkti ilma\n"
"deformeerivad.  See töötab ainult paarisarvu tetraeedritega ja\n"
"neid peab olema kaheksa või rohkem, muidu ei sobi.\n"
"\n"
"Kirjutas Jamie Zawinski; 2013. aasta.\n"
"  "

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/kallisti.xml.h:1
msgid "Kallisti"
msgstr "Kallis"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/kallisti.xml.h:18
msgid ""
"\n"
"The golden apple of discord.\n"
"\n"
"Greek goddess Eris was not invited to a wedding; her retort was to toss in "
"a\n"
"golden apple, inscribed: \"to the fairest\".  Hera, Athena and Aphrodite\n"
"squabbled over it; Zeus noped out, telling Paris of Troy to decide. They "
"all\n"
"cheated, but Aphrodite won by letting Paris abduct and marry Helen of "
"Sparta.\n"
"The Greeks objected to this, leading to the Trojan War.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to launch a thousand ships? Because this is how you launch a\n"
"thousand ships.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Judgement_of_Paris\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski and Jared Williams; 2024.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ebakõla kuldõun.\n"
"\n"
"Kreeka jumalanna Erist ei kutsutud pulma; tema repliik oli visata sisse a\n"
"kuldne õun, millele on kirjutatud: \"kõige õiglasemale\".  Hera, Athena ja "
"Aphrodite\n"
"kakles selle pärast; Zeus noogutas ja käskis Trooja Pariisil otsustada. Nad "
"kõik\n"
"pettis, kuid Aphrodite võitis, lastes Parisel Sparta Heleniga röövida ja "
"abielluda.\n"
"Kreeklased vaidlesid sellele vastu, mis viis Trooja sõjani.\n"
"\n"
"tuhat laeva.Kas soovite tuhat laeva vette lasta? Sest nii käivitate a\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Judgement_of_Paris\n"
"\n"
"Kirjutanud Jamie Zawinski ja Jared Williams; 2024. aasta.\n"
"  "

