# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/quasicrystal.xml.h:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"A quasicrystal is a structure that is ordered but aperiodic.\n"
"\n"
"Two-dimensional quasicrystals can be generated by adding a set of\n"
"planes where x is the sine of y.  Different complex aperiodic plane\n"
"tilings are produced depending on the period, position, and rotation\n"
"of the component planes, and whether the rotation of the planes is\n"
"evenly distributed around the circle (the \"symmetry\" option, above)\n"
"or random.\n"
"\n"
"See also the \"RD-Bomb\", \"CWaves\" and \"Penrose\" screen savers.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quasicrystal\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2013.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kvaasikristall on struktuur, mis on korrastatud, kuid aperioodiline.\n"
"\n"
"plaate toodetakse sõltuvalt perioodist, asukohast ja pöörlemisest\n"
"komponenttasanditest ja kas tasandite pöörlemine on\n"
"Kahemõõtmelisi kvaasikristalle saab genereerida, lisades komplekti\n"
"ühtlaselt ümber ringi jaotatud (\"sümmeetria\" valik ülal)\n"
"tasapinnad, kus x on y siinus.  või juhuslikult.Erinevad komplekssed "
"aperioodilised tasapinnad\n"
"\n"
"Vaata ka ekraanisäästjaid \"RD-Bomb\", \"CWaves\" ja \"Penrose\".\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quasicrystal\n"
"\n"
"Kirjutas Jamie Zawinski; 2013. aasta.\n"
"  "

